# Generated reports — regenerate with `just report` / `just validate-all`
reports/
# ...except the research manifest, which is NOT regenerable. It records what
# was actually paid for: which novel terms were researched, how long each took,
# and which failed and why. Re-running would cost the whole batch again.

# Generated from the LinkML schema by `just gen-schema`
src/antibioticmech/schema/antibioticmech_dataclasses.py

